refused: d144_label_value_in_another_unit.cy:15:28, line 15 column 28
15 |     draw(at.screen.pixels: 5 screen.points);
   |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 what: this is `i32[unit: screen.points]`, and the label asks for `i32[unit: screen.pixels]`
 why:  a label's unit takes a plain number or that unit, and a value in another is refused (D144)
